# PRODUCT REQUIREMENTS DOCUMENT (PRD): MUSIFY (ANDROID)

- **Product Name:** Musify
- **Version:** 3.0 (Full Spotify-Class App Architecture + Zero-Bug Production Specification)
- **Target Platform:** Android Only — Android 8.0 (API 26) to Android 16 (API 36) (ARM64-v8a & ARMv7)
- **UI Framework:** Flutter (Impeller Renderer Enabled)
- **Audio Engine (Option A):** `flutter_soloud` (`^3.1.0+` / C++ SoLoud & `miniaudio` via Dart FFI) — **Strictly NO `media_kit`**
- **Background & OS Integration:** `audio_service` (`^0.18.18`) + `audio_session` (`^0.1.25+`)
- **State Management & Persistence:** `flutter_bloc` (BLoC & Cubit) + `get_it` + `hive_flutter` / `shared_preferences` (Local Library, Liked Songs, Playlists, History & Settings Persistence)
- **Design Paradigm:** Swiss-Minimalism (Flat 2.0) paired with Tactile Minimal Skeuomorphism
- **Core Differentiator:** Complete Spotify-grade music streaming experience (Home, Real-Time Search, Genre Discovery, Offline Library, Playlists, Equalizer & Settings) combined with a 1-Tap Real-Time **8D Spatial Audio Hardware Toggle** (360° LFO Orbit + Psychoacoustic Rear Low-Pass Filter + Hall Reverb).

---

## 1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY & PRODUCT VISION

**Musify** is a full-featured, open-source, ad-free Android music streaming application with the feature completeness of Spotify—including a personalized **Home Feed**, debounced **Multi-Filter Search & Genre Browser**, persistent **User Library (Liked Songs, Custom Playlists, Offline Downloads)**, and a comprehensive **Settings & Audio Engineering Lab**—all wrapped in an iconic **Swiss-Minimalist × Tactile Skeuomorphic** interface.

Under the hood, Musify completely avoids heavy video libraries (`media_kit`) and instead runs on **`flutter_soloud`** (C++ SoLoud via Dart FFI) paired with **`audio_service`**. Tapping the physical-style **`[8D AUDIO]`** switch converts any streaming or downloaded song into a real-time 360-degree orbiting concert-hall experience and reverts seamlessly to bit-perfect stereo when turned off.

