## 2. FREE 3RD-PARTY BACKGROUND API ARCHITECTURE

Musify operates with **zero paid API keys** and **zero server costs** by combining five free 3rd-party APIs in an automatic background waterfall:

| Layer | Free 3rd-Party API / Package | Format & Quality | Auth Required? | Purpose in Musify |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **1. Primary Audio Stream** | **JioSaavn API** (`saavn.dev` / internal `api.php` with DES-ECB decryption) | **320 kbps / 160 kbps** AAC (`.mp4`/`.m4a`) & MP3 | No (100% Free) | Primary music engine for Home charts, Search, Albums, Playlists, and direct 320 kbps HTTP CDN streams. |
| **2. Global Fallback Stream** | **YouTube Music InnerTube API** (`youtube_explode_dart` & `dart_ytmusic_api`) | **160 kbps Opus** (`.webm`) / **128 kbps AAC** (`.m4a`) | No (100% Free) | Fallback for underground tracks, remixes, phonk, indie releases, and global songs not on JioSaavn. |
| **3. Anti-Throttle Proxy** | **Piped / Invidious Public API** (`pipedapi.kavin.rocks`) | **160 kbps Opus / AAC** | No (100% Free) | Backup stream relay if YouTube temporarily rate-limits the user's mobile IP. |
| **4. Time-Synced Lyrics** | **LRCLIB Public API** (`https://lrclib.net/api/get`) | Millisecond-synced `.lrc` & plain text | No (100% Free) | Fetches karaoke-synced lyrics matched by `track_name`, `artist_name`, and `duration`. |
| **5. Metadata & Charts** | **Deezer API** (`api.deezer.com`) & **iTunes Search API** | JSON + **1000×1000 px** square JPEG | No (100% Free) | Supplies global top charts, genre playlists, artist bios, and uncompressed 1:1 album artwork. |

