   - **Search:** 350ms debounced search across Songs, Albums, Artists, and Playlists + clickable Swiss Genre & Mood cards + working `⋮` Track Context Menu.
   - **Library:** Persistent Liked Songs, Custom Playlists (Create/Edit/Delete/Import URL), and Offline Downloads saved locally via `Hive`.
   - **Settings:** Functional controls for Streaming Quality (320k/160k/96k), 8D Orbit Speed & Reverb calibration, SoLoud Equalizer, Cache Clearing, and JSON Backup/Restore.
